        <div class="text reveal reveal-bottom duration-400">
            <p class="subtitle">Success Stories</p>
            <h3 class="title">Data-fueled growth: How OnePay is becoming one of the world’s leading fintechs</h3>
            <p class="description">OnePay, majority-owned by Walmart, is simplifying banking with its all-in-one financial experience. 
            <br /><br />
            The collaboration with Qubika has enabled OnePay to harness data-driven insights, driving its growth and delivering a superior banking experience to customers. It has become one of the standout leaders in the fintech industry.</p>
            <ul class="pills">
